<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείων</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lessen, diminish</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔξω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.21
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὸ χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.20.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὸν ὁπλισμὸν τοῖς θώραξιν</span>
			<i>diminish</i> the armour <i>by</i> the breast-pieces, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειούμενον φόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFay.</u>
					26.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <i>moderate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἄγαν κάθαρσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					5.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lessen in honour, degrade</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.4.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐξ Ἀρείου πάγου βουλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.77
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lessen by word, disparage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.17
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hier.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔξειν καὶ μειοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1403a17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>shorten</i> a syllable, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				11
			</span></i>: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξεων κατὰ ποσότητα
				μεμειωμένων</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.909
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>become smaller, decrease</i>, in size, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλὴν ἐμειοῦτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				409c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελήνη μειουμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					399a7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.153
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>become worse</i> or <i>weaker</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὴν διάνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.8.1
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>fall short of</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν
				. . μεγάλα θυόντων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.3.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τοῦ σώματος ἰσχύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.5.65
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
